From 61a29f8080630da0a4c6f1e6f88a39841a2e7d97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bar Moshe <1barmoshe1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 15:48:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(od-sevev): paint the Balfour protest signs as
 handmade kraft cardboard (B14 D')

Bar picked option D'. The 8 pink/white boards read as a v2 leftover once v4 took pink
out of the chrome. They are now kraft cardboard (stone / stone_sh) with a hand-cut corner
and two right-aligned 1-px marker rows in ink or flag_hi: never centred (a face), never
red (the alert colour), never a letter. The stage (locations.kraft_sign) and the wings
(wave7._kraft_sign) share the painter and the seeded (k, side), so the seam holds.

stage_balfour.png changes 624 px in art rows 177-188: Bar-approved drift, so the approved
showcase out/ is updated and a full render gives 0 drift. Wings and the locations overview
are re-rendered; pink's palette role and both style guides are updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
