From f4431a6022e2dbc7901048c5431a354a61ec7c77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bar Moshe <1barmoshe1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:17:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(od-sevev): add Mordechai David, the protest blocker,
 rendered down from Bar's ref
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bar wants Mordechai David to walk on and plant himself in front of the protest crowd.
A custom render-down rig (showcase/src/mordechai.py) poses his arms (with their sleeves)
and legs at ref resolution, keeps the shoulder caps and a shaded tee under the arms, and
downscales to 96 art px with one palette locked from idle frame 0, at d 3 and d 2 like the
cast. Anims: idle 20, walk 8, block_in 4, a 3-frame block hold and a smug glance at the
player. The block is asymmetric so his reach stays out of the leader's slot. The orange
cap and tee stay: they are his signature and read apart from the v4 blue chrome.

The showcase and pipeline full renders change 0 existing characters. CONTRACT §4 gives
the frames, anchors, walk speed, reach and the Balfour placement.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
